WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.381 --> 00:00:11.801
[Maggie]
<i>Previously on Dead City.</i>

2
00:00:12.274 --> 00:00:13.535
- Hershel?!
- [Hershel] Mom!

3
00:00:13.709 --> 00:00:15.363
[loud blast]

4
00:00:15.493 --> 00:00:17.191
Name's Dillard.

5
00:00:17.365 --> 00:00:19.106
- [Cockenspiel growls earnestly]
- [Dillard] That is dastardly.

6
00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.933
That is fresh.

7
00:00:21.108 --> 00:00:22.196
[Renata] Maggie. you should
bring your people here.

8
00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:24.415
Everything the Croat said
about this place is true.

9
00:00:24.589 --> 00:00:26.200
It is a fortress.

10
00:00:26.591 --> 00:00:28.680
I need this one last thing
from you.

11
00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:31.292
- So what kind of doctor are you?
- Emergency medicine.

12
00:00:31.466 --> 00:00:33.076
- Can I help?
- Come on.

13
00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:35.426
Once we find the Dama.
who's left to stop us?

14
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.994
Half of Midtown is gone.

15
00:00:38.168 --> 00:00:40.214
Our work is just beginning.

16
00:00:41.693 --> 00:00:47.569
[wind blowing]

17
00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.404
[intensifying music]

18
00:00:58.145 --> 00:01:02.410
[walker growling]

19
00:01:04.629 --> 00:01:06.544
[knife squelching]

20
00:01:06.675 --> 00:01:11.419
[music by Lee Wiley starts.
Manhattan]

