48
00:03:23.638 --> 00:03:28.033
♪ And eat baloney on a roll ♪

49
00:03:28.991 --> 00:03:33.213
♪ In Central Park.
we'll stroll ♪

50
00:03:33.648 --> 00:03:37.216
♪ Where our first kiss.
we stole ♪

51
00:03:37.608 --> 00:03:39.567
♪ Soul to soul ♪

52
00:03:40.045 --> 00:03:41.829
♪ AndSouth Pacific ♪

53
00:03:42.483 --> 00:03:46.400
♪ Is a terrific show.
they say ♪

54
00:03:47.314 --> 00:03:51.187
♪ We both may see it close

55
