00:42:55.703 --> 00:42:58.097
I hope you'll come back.
all of you.

747
00:42:59.881 --> 00:43:01.927
I appreciate it. I do. but...

748
00:43:03.842 --> 00:43:05.234
I'm not comin' back here.

749
00:43:05.974 --> 00:43:07.280
At least not for a while.

750
00:43:09.238 --> 00:43:10.936
You're not goin' back just
for your family. are ya?

751
00:43:12.590 --> 00:43:14.461
[Armstrong]
New Babylon needs me.

752
00:43:14.548 --> 00:43:16.028
With the army gone.

753
00:43:16.158 --> 00:43:17.464
I know things have probably
changed there and. if not.

754
00:43:17.551 --> 00:43:18.987
there are a few of us who've
been waitin' on a chance

755
00:43:19.074 --> 00:43:20.075
to change it.

756
00:43:20.946 --> 00:43:25.559
- This is it.
- If anybody can do it. you can.

757
00:43:26.429 --> 00:43:27.300
Thank you.

758
00:43:28.344 --> 00:43:29.345
And once I do.

759
00:43:29.955 --> 00:43:31.826
you better believe that the two
of us are gonna have a lot

760
00:43:31.957 --> 00:43:32.871
to talk about.

761
00:43:32.958 --> 00:43:38.920
[gentle music]
[waves splashing]

762
00:43:49.061 --> 00:43:55.110
[walkers snarling]

763
00:44:09.908 --> 00:44:12.345
You can tell
your drawling counterpart...

764
00:44:13.825 --> 00:44:18.525
this tuna casserole
is pedestrian at best.

765
00:44:22.964 --> 00:44:25.184
- What?
- I thought you might be dead.

766
00:44:26.838 --> 00:44:28.056
Now I get to kill ya.

767
00:44:28.143 --> 00:44:34.149
[walkers snarling]
[tense music]

768
00:44:40.155 --> 00:44:42.549
- I'm armed.
- Cool.

769
00:44:42.680 --> 00:44:47.075
[tense music continues]
[walkers snarling]

770
00:44:47.162 --> 00:44:48.207
Help!

771
00:44:48.773 --> 00:44:51.906
Someone come down here! Help!
Somebody come down here!

772
00:44:51.993 --> 00:44:54.909
Help me! Help!

773
00:44:54.996 --> 00:44:57.825
- Insane. right?
- Someone come down here!

774
00:44:57.912 --> 00:45:01.611
No guards.
A psychopath like you?

775
00:45:01.699 --> 00:45:06.094
And no one but little ol' me
to keep this place safe.

776
00:45:06.181 --> 00:45:09.097
[dramatic music]

777
00:45:09.184 --> 00:45:10.620
[Dama groaning]
[knife clattering]

778
00:45:10.708 --> 00:45:16.714
[dramatic music continues]

779
00:45:19.891 --> 00:45:21.196
[Maggie] Hey. you okay?

780
00:45:23.416 --> 00:45:27.246
Once we pull that switch.
there's no turnin' back.

781
00:45:28.595 --> 00:45:30.466
I know that you
have a plan to deal

782
00:45:30.597 --> 00:45:33.034
with any bad people who might
be drawn our way...

783
00:45:33.295 --> 00:45:35.776
[Maggie]
You're worried about the island?

784
00:45:35.863 --> 00:45:36.864
It's like I told you.

785
00:45:36.951 --> 00:45:41.608
No Christos. no Bruegel.
and no Croat.

786
00:45:42.522 --> 00:45:44.437
What about the guy
who trained The Croat?

787
00:45:45.525 --> 00:45:47.005
[Maggie] Negan has changed.

788
00:45:49.181 --> 00:45:51.618
[Renata]
But it's still in him. Maggie.

789
00:45:52.401 --> 00:45:55.883
And that... That's bad.

790
00:45:57.102 --> 00:45:58.973
Honestly. the thing
that scares me is...

791
00:45:59.931 --> 00:46:03.630
I don't know if it's bad
for them or for us.

792
00:46:06.285 --> 00:46:08.548
Ain't no fun
when the rabbit's got the gun.

793
00:46:09.679 --> 00:46:12.639
[music intensifies]

794
00:46:15.947 --> 00:46:16.774
Ready?

795
00:46:17.905 --> 00:46:18.819
Here we go.

796
00:46:18.906 --> 00:46:23.563
[tense music]

797
00:46:23.693 --> 00:46:29.743
[machines whirring]

798
00:46:31.223 --> 00:46:37.229
[majestic music]

799
00:47:06.780 --> 00:47:12.655
[tense music]
[walkers growling]

800
00:47:12.742 --> 00:47:18.705
[Dama growling]

801
00:47:32.414 --> 00:47:37.680
[tense music]

802
00:47:37.811 --> 00:47:38.812
What do you think it means?

803
00:47:40.161 --> 00:47:41.336
I think we should see.

804
00:47:42.337 --> 00:47:48.343
[man whistling]
[suspenseful music]

805
00:48:05.534 --> 00:48:07.101
Put your weapons down.
everyone!

806
00:48:07.188 --> 00:48:08.146
Weapons down!

807
00:48:08.320 --> 00:48:10.800
♪♪

808
00:48:10.888 --> 00:48:12.759
I need to know
that I can trust you

809
00:48:12.890 --> 00:48:14.717
if shit hits the fan.

810
00:48:15.980 --> 00:48:17.590
We're going on lockdown.

811
00:48:17.720 --> 00:48:19.200
With everything happening.
we can't be too careful.

812
00:48:19.287 --> 00:48:22.725
♪♪

813
00:48:22.812 --> 00:48:25.946
Two groups of people.
But only one can stay.

814
00:48:26.033 --> 00:48:27.730
So we're gonna play a game.

815
00:48:27.905 --> 00:48:32.344
♪♪
